   "height": 93.75,
   "text": "doctor examines stages 0 to the declared one and no\nfurther. At stage 1 it answers \"not examined\" for\nstages 2 and 3 — so the one question a stage\nselector exists to answer, what stage 2 would\nrequire, is the question doctor currently declines.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "doctor examines stages 0 to the declared one and no\nfurther. At stage 1 it answers \"not examined\" for\nstages 2 and 3 — so the one question a stage\nselector exists to answer, what stage 2 would\nrequire, is the question doctor currently declines.",
