   "x": 1419.6,
   "y": 384,
   "width": 390.0,
   "height": 93.75,
   "text": "breaks stops a flow and is the only level the exit\nstatus reads; advises is a recommendation; unread is\na check the forge would not answer. A stage row can\nbe green, amber or grey off these three without\ninventing a vocabulary.",
   "fontSize": 15,
